le MockMvc request builder API does not provide remoteAddr(String) in this Spring version. RequestPostProcessor directly sets MockHttpServletRequest.remoteAddr while preserving the production behavior under test.","alternatives":["Use a custom servlet filter or mocked request, which would reduce coverage of the real HTTP layer.","Remove remote-IP assertions, which would leave rate-limit client isolation insufficiently tested."]}]}

