    },
    {
      "id": "AC5",
      "met": true,
      "evidence": "Tests rateLimitIsIndependentForDifferentRemoteAddresses and concurrentAdmissionCannotExceedThirtyRequestsForOneIp pass. The limiter keys state by client IP in a ConcurrentHashMap with per-bucket synchronization."
